<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CVRD auction off -gov't attorney.</title>
<headline>Brazil CVRD auction off -gov't attorney.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's most senior attorney said Tuesday's privatization of Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD) had been suspended following a court injunction against the sale.</p>
<p>Geraldo Magela Quintao, the head of the Federal Advocacy, said the government would appeal Wednesday against the injunction, which was issued by a court in Rio de Janiero.</p>
</text>
